{"about_the_game":"The Three Kingdoms: The Story of Seeking the General is an innovative strategy game of the Three Kingdoms War that does not draw cards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The real name will be unique </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301790/extras/ad96571e9701e60c54c5a62e72d2ab68.avif?t=1749661305\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>There are nearly a thousand real celebrities here, and each of them is the only one in the whole service. Every famous general is subdued by arrest. There is no brainless card here. All famous generals are unique.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Combat instant strategy </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301790/extras/f495e903f45d52abe1a1d27dae63a9f9.avif?t=1749661305\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>The battle here is directed, and it is a test of technology. The use of restraint relations between arms and the real-time operation of mobile commands will change the outcome of the war.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Real time strategy </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301790/extras/2be58bb0b354ea5bb6fc043e4478a032.avif?t=1749661305\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>Here, not only courage but also intelligence are needed. Real-time tactics can also change the outcome of the war. Immediate command and strategic confrontation. A rich knack system, a combination of multiple tricks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Map of more than 1000 famous cities </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301790/extras/810b87764c348a79a6a67df6dd9c38c6.avif?t=1749661305\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>There is a huge real city system here, with thousands of historical real-name cities, which are composed of five l